Error [E3102]: Inline assembly is part of the low-level memory tier
  --> tests/ui/ffi_asm_no_mem.jet:1:38
    |
  1 | #[Unsafe("register-only increment"), FFI(asm)] fn increment(value: Int) Int -> {
    |                                      ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Assembly can read registers and memory outside Jet's safe value model, so discovery requires the explicit `core.mem` opt-in
 Fix: Add `use core.mem` at the top of this file
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3102
